Tiantui Star's Blade:
1. Gunblade
2. Two ammo types, switch between with gizmo: Tigerslayer Round (steel), Savage Tigerslayer Round (uranium)
3. Abilities depend on round: Tigerslayer (Tigerslayer Round), Savage Tigerslayer's Perfected Flurry of Blades [超絕猛虎殺擊亂斬] (Savage round), Tripleslash (Normal attacks) (third hit triggers a round), Blasting Tripleslash (normal attacks) (every hit triggers a round) (Savage).
4. Tigerslayer rounds (both) increase damage of the weapon and make it inflict burn damage.
5. Inner Spirit hediff (changes to extreme strength in savage); Inner spirit directly buffs Shin from my other mod.
6. Shin - Tiantui Star if you have this relic and shin and mang
7. Downside: Overheating
8. Aptitude influences how fast the weapon overheats 
9. Spending ammo on the end of a skill (the third hit of tripleslash and variants) or at the end of Tigerslayer does stun damage (tremor)

Visuals:
1. Bladetrail when ammo is expended (steal from arayashiki)
2. Exhaust flames and smoke
3. Bladetrail when reloading/Swapping ammo
